<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended Nov 16 totalled 119.858 million, versus a revised 124.012 million in the previous week and 121.352 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.    Eggs set in those states in</p>
<p>the same week totalled 163.901 million, versus a revised 164.818 million the previous week and 166.879 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
</text>
